#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0267 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "Unversioned reference terminologies are excluded (owner, round 2026-10-02 c, reopening finding CG0267-F1/SD1260-F1): UNII, ISO 8601, ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 and clinicaltrials.gov carry no version, so an empty TSVCDVER is correct for them. Row 1 (UNII) and row 3 (ISO 8601), both with TSVCDVER empty, are not findings; row 2 (MEDDRA 21.0) is versioned and populated. Goes red if the exclusion list is dropped or loses UNII or ISO 8601; the other two names are pinned by invalid_versioned_among_unversioned. Extended 2026-10-03 (round close review, owner agreed): the names the printed SDTMIG TS examples leave unversioned (ISO 3166 / ISO 3166 Alpha-3, EudraCT / EUDRAC, DUNS / D-U-N-S, ISO 21090), one row each."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
col TSVALCD  type=Char label="Parameter Value Code"
col TSVCDREF type=Char label="Name of the Reference Terminology"
col TSVCDVER type=Char label="Version of the Reference Terminology"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 1 | TRT | Investigational Therapy or Treatment | XANOMELINE | U6RSY2UBI4 | UNII |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 2 | INDIC | Trial Indication | ASTHMA | 10003553 | MEDDRA | 21.0
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 3 | SSTDTC | Study Start Date | 2012-07-09 |  | ISO 8601 |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 4 | FCNTRY | Planned Country of Investigational Sites | USA | USA | ISO 3166 |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 5 | FCNTRY | Planned Country of Investigational Sites | CAN | CAN | ISO 3166 Alpha-3 |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 6 | REGID | Registry Identifier | 2010-000000-00 | 2010-000000-00 | EudraCT |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 7 | REGID | Registry Identifier | 2010-000000-01 | 2010-000000-01 | EUDRAC |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 8 | SPONSOR | Clinical Study Sponsor | Example Pharma | 123456789 | DUNS |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 9 | SPONSOR | Clinical Study Sponsor | Example Pharma | 123456789 | D-U-N-S |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 10 | TRT | Investigational Therapy or Treatment | PLACEBO | PLACEBO | ISO 21090 |
